						(size 1.016 1.016)
					)
				)
			)
			(property "Power Notes" "VCC module input: 4.8-5.5V, typical supply capability 1A. ESP_LDO_VO4 is a configurable LDO OUTPUT rated max 200mA (0.5-2.7V or 3.3V), not an input."
